  "$comment": "The one shared limits file (spine S9.5, G section 14). Numbers are [ASSUMPTION] unless the plan marks them [CONFIRMED] (attemptsPerSlot). Read directly by Python (api/, from Phase 12) and turned into TypeScript by web/game-core/scripts/gen-contracts.ts (web/shared/src/limits.ts and web/game-core/src/rules/contracts.generated.ts). Every number in contracts/schemas/ that is a limit must equal the value here; a Vitest test checks it. API Gateway throttles live in Terraform, not here. picture.kinds (Gate P2): each kind's stored PNG size (width x height), the largest SVG picture-gen accepts for it (svgMaxBytes), the largest decoded and stored PNG (maxBytes; also admin-api's read cap for a draft) and R34 JSON body (bodyMaxBytes) for it, and optionally maxTokens for its Claude call (else picture-gen's BEDROCK_MAX_TOKENS) and capWeight, how many places one drawing takes in the daily and monthly caps (else 1). Gate P2 background (owner 2026-11-16): the game's 1920 x 1056 logical canvas; 4 MiB PNG cap so the base64 draft (5.59 MB) fits Lambda's 6 MB response. bodyMaxBytes.adminPicture is the largest kind's body, the route's first guard.",
